<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanta raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanta raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it upgraded Advanta Corp to strong buy from buy, in part citing the stock price.</p>
<p>-- analyst Elizabeth Summers said that while the stock price is &quot;volatile...at current levels, we believe Advanta is trading at a very attractive multiple of earnings.&quot;</p>
<p>-- &quot;A&quot; shares fell 4-3/8 to 43-5/8 on Friday.</p>
</text>
